OL,5,G1830 Paul Sinha's Perfect Pub Quiz
OL,6,     F4/6. Paul challenges his audience
OL,7,     Fin Boston, Lincolnshire, to listen
OL,8,     Fvery carefully. Will they see the
OL,9,     Ftrick questions coming?
OL,10,G1900 The Archers
OL,11,     FLilian attempts to offer some
OL,12,     Fwords of comfort, and Pat has a
OL,13,     Fbone to pick.
OL,14,G1915 Front Row
OL,15,     FTom Sutcliffe and guests including
OL,16,     FSarah Churchwell, Kevin Le Gendre,
OL,17,     FErin Pauwels and Matt Wolf explore
OL,18,     Fthe cultural founding fathers and
OL,19,     Fmothers of America.
